  "title": "Maggie&#39;s Camper Specials",
  "description": "A unique blend of salted peanuts, chocolate chips, espresso and coconut result in a crispy, crunchy cookie. Great for traveling or camping because the cookie maintains its crispness for several days.",
  "authors": [
    "MAGGIE MCGUIRE"
